        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    current_dividend = 0.22\n    high_growth_rate = 0.12\n    stable_growth_rate = 0.06\n    required_rate_of_return = 0.09\n    high_growth_years = 4\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    dividend_year_4 = current_dividend * (1 + high_growth_rate) ** high_growth_years\n    dividend_year_5 = dividend_year_4 * (1 + stable_growth_rate)\n    terminal_value = dividend_year_5 / (required_rate_of_return - stable_growth_rate)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(terminal_value, 3)\n```",
